    "filters": "Apply race history/body/roster/Hybrid exclusions before sampling; retain canonical per-sector base weights then renormalize surviving outcomes. Full40/33.33/26.67 masses can shift after exclusions or declared modifiers; do not refill or dynamically rebalance bands.",
    "equalizer": "An authorized active Equalizer replaces final weights with1 per hard-eligible outcome after guards; no group-mass postprocessor follows it.",
    "rankMeaning": "Authoring order/distributionBand is relative package strength and variability, independent of intrinsic Power Tier1–5, gate boostBand, raw stat scores or guaranteed combat victory.",
    "events": "Do not change child catalogs, ratios, guarantees, rewards, mastery/bonus timing, source history or final stat weighting. No extra tier-to-stat conversion.",
    "references": "Every canonical Race reference/owned invocation reuses current Race weights under its caller guards. Warlord Army Type is its separate23-sector wheel, unchanged; canonical race-family followups inherit these weights.",
    "history": "Freeze versions/eligible pools/weights per new invocation; committed old journals and source-video catalogs do not update."
  },
